WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:09.884 --> 00:00:12.053
This male Arctic fox

00:00:12.053 --> 00:00:15.432
has spent the last six months

00:00:15.849 --> 00:00:18.101
alone.

00:00:20.186 --> 00:00:23.440
He really goes the distance

00:00:23.440 --> 00:00:27.110
when food is in short supply.

00:00:27.277 --> 00:00:30.864
One even clocked
more than a thousand miles

00:00:30.864 --> 00:00:34.034
in just over two months.

00:00:37.746 --> 00:00:39.456
This little guy

00:00:39.456 --> 00:00:43.626
has been surviving off his street smarts.

00:00:49.007 --> 00:00:51.217
You can't be too careful

00:00:51.217 --> 00:00:54.637
when you're only 12 inches tall

00:00:59.309 --> 00:01:00.852
In the Arctic

00:01:00.852 --> 00:01:04.147
even leftovers are a reason to celebrate.

00:01:16.910 --> 00:01:19.245
With spring in the air

00:01:19.245 --> 00:01:22.082
he's heading home to reunite

00:01:22.082 --> 00:01:24.542
with his lifelong mate.

00:01:33.635 --> 00:01:36.846
They spent the long winter apart

00:01:36.846 --> 00:01:39.724
searching for food.

00:01:43.812 --> 00:01:45.730
He must find her.

00:01:45.730 --> 00:01:48.942
If there's any hope of starting a family.

00:01:58.451 --> 00:02:01.121
Maybe she hasn't survived

00:02:01.121 --> 00:02:02.288
the winter.

00:02:16.636 --> 00:02:19.931
Ah, there she is.

00:02:23.893 --> 00:02:26.229
Together again.

00:02:34.154 --> 00:02:36.406
Time to get on with the business

00:02:36.406 --> 00:02:39.075
of becoming a mom and dad

00:02:39.075 --> 00:02:41.953
and to raise their litter of pups before

00:02:41.953 --> 00:02:43.997
the end of summer.

